TEXT 56 24 Left 2 !.meas maxV MAX V(vout)
TEXT 72 72 Left 2 !.meas minv MIN V(vout)
TEXT 96 144 Left 2 !.meas TRAN dv PARAM (maxV-minv)/2
TEXT 64 -200 Left 2 !.param freq=1000
